# Phaser / React

- Dual panel: `DungeonScene` (pixel art) + `TerminalPanel` (IBM Plex Mono). Do not merge them.
- Sprite sheet `/assets/kenney/tiny-dungeon/tilemap_packed.png`: 16×16, 12 columns, spacing 0. Use UX.md keys (`seat_guardian`, `room_01_broken_shell`, `gem_complete`, …). `pixelArt: true`.
- REST lives in `src/api/client.ts`. Match engine camelCase session fields. Proxy `/api` and `/ws` only.
- Seats are cosmetic. Submit commands as typed; do not filter by `seatId`.
- No Web Speech, no `child_process`, no `oc` from the browser. Keep the CRT look in CSS, readable type in the log.
